It is Wednesday evening.
I am at the gym for my regular class.
I am lifting weights today.
My arms are tired, but it is nice.
I think about the last few days.
It has been a very busy week.
I have worked closely with the whole team.
I have learned a lot about their different professions.
I have sat many hours at my computer.
I have written a lot of new code this week.
I have given my first presentation to the team.
It has been a little hard, but also fun.
I have gotten to know my new colleagues better.
I feel better and better at the office.
The workout is lovely after a long day.
I really need to move.
Everyone has worked hard.
I put the weights on the floor and drink a little water.
I smile to myself in the mirror.
I am finally a real part of the team.
